Spoilers:
























Telepathy: Eat a floating eye corpse
Sleep resistance: Elf corpses
Fire res. :Fire giants, fire ants, red dragons
Shock res: Blue dragon corpse, black/brown puddings
Disentegration res: Black Dragon
Cold resistance: White dragon, winter wolf, frost giant
intrinsic teleportation: leprechaun, nymph, tengu
teleport control: tengu
intrinsic polymorph: Chameleon corpse (note: not permanent and *definitely*
                     not recommended)
Poison resistance: Shreiker, unicorn corpse, killer bees
magic resistance: Only wearing GDSM, or cloak of magic resistance. I think
                  Magicbane gives it to you, but you must be weilding it.
speed: Zap yourself with a wand of speed monster (use "." for direction)
invisibility: Zap yourself with Make Invisible wand. (You can't enter shops
              while invisible, though.)
Eating wraith corpses raises you one experience level.
Eating giant corpses increase your strength.
Note that this list isn't all inclusive. Other monster corpses give you
intrinsics as well.
Magic items also give intrinsics, for example, wearing a ring of searching
gives you intrinsic automatic searching.
Different characters start out with different intrinsics, and gain new
intrinsics after a certain level is gained.

